@startuml
title EchoEats - Dynamic Pricing Activity Diagram

start
:Read initial price, minimum price, remaining time, and customer demand;
:Calculate pricing progress;

switch (Select pricing method?)
case (Linear)
  :Use progress unchanged;
case (Exponential)
  :Raise progress to power 2.2;
case (Stepped)
  :Divide progress into four stages;
endswitch

:Calculate demand ratio;

if (Demand ratio >= 0.50?) then (High demand)
  :Set demand factor to 0.65;
else (Not high)
  if (Demand ratio < 0.15?) then (Low demand)
    :Set demand factor to 1.10;
  else (Normal demand)
    :Set demand factor to 0.90;
  endif
endif

:Calculate proposed discounted price;
:Limit maximum discount to 85%;
:Apply minimum and maximum price limits;

if (Price has changed?) then (Yes)
  :Update current selling price;
else (No)
  :Keep current selling price;
endif

:Produce final selling price;
stop
@enduml
